# terrain-readback.manifest - freecam poses for the retained-terrain
# shared-vertex position readback (tests/harness/check_terrain_readback.sh).
#
# One row per pose:  <level> | pos=(x, y, z) yaw=Y pitch=P | [start VBL]
#   level  a --skip-to-level name
#   pose   a freecam pose string (the per-tick freecam log format, verbatim)
#   start  the capture VBL (default: the freecam corpus's canonical VBL)
#
# The rows together put every named arena family pair on screen at both LOD
# tiers: plain/plain, plain/anim, plain/near, anim/near, cell/near,
# cell/anim, cell/cell and cut/cut (tools/terrain_readback.py). anim/near
# needs a poly-anim sector whose bounding sphere lies wholly beyond the near
# threshold (anim arena) beside a static sector that crosses the camera
# plane (near arena): the camera stands on the static neighbour just outside
# the anim sector's sphere, looking at it.
summer_forest | pos=(130413, 15471, 38359) yaw=1088 pitch=160
# anim/near and cell/anim: the freecam corpus's first
# idol_springs row.
idol_springs | pos=(115428, 98127, 14292) yaw=-1135 pitch=160
# cell/anim and anim/near: the camera on sector 17 outside poly-anim
# sector 75's sphere.
summer_forest | pos=(111280, 54073, 30016) yaw=46 pitch=60
# Second anim/near, cell/anim and cut/cut poses: tools/terrain_readback_poses.py
# over a sector dump at the named pose topdown (OPENPETE_TERRAIN_FP32_EMU
# slot vertices, the readback's anim-arena slots), extended LOD: the camera
# 250 units above the vertex of a static slot that shares world vertices
# with a poly-anim slot, about 2500 units beyond the anim slot's vertex
# radius, looking at its centroid.
# Anim slot 119 against static slot 232 (25 shared vertices).
summer_forest | pos=(50976, 67584, 48442) yaw=0 pitch=181
# Anim slot 70 against static slot 240 (20 shared vertices).
summer_forest | pos=(55056, 86944, 47354) yaw=-1835 pitch=209
